  m_Name: The Last Keeper
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  projectName: The Last Keeper
  description: "A vertical slice built around the challenge of designing a compelling
    VR walking game \u2014 and the first project in ITU's Game World Design course
    to ship a complete VR experience. \n\nI handled sound design, music &  implementation,
    voice acting, and production \u2014 managing the pipeline across Miroboard and
    Trello, coordinating with contributors outside ITU, and leading pitch presentations.\nVR
    production breaks a lot of conventional rules, and as project manager that meant
    making tough scope calls \u2014 grounding the team's ideas in what actually works
    in VR and what the project could realistically deliver. Previous VR experience
    made that easier, but it's never a comfortable conversation."
